@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 13. MCP State Machine (Current Source)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUEST_VALIDATED
REQUEST_VALIDATED --> HISTORY_LOADED
HISTORY_LOADED --> PLANNED

PLANNED --> EXECUTING : planRequired=true
PLANNED --> COMPOSING : planRequired=false

EXECUTING --> COMPOSING : execute loop finished

COMPOSING --> COMPLETED

COMPLETED --> [*]
HUMAN_MESSAGE --> [*]
ERROR --> HUMAN_MESSAGE

note right of EXECUTING
Tool loop is bounded
- execute plan
- append trace
- re-plan
- max iterations guard (4)
end note

@enduml
